msgid ""
"Generators used to generate the depot list. Generators need the method "
"signature ``generator_name(context)``"
msgstr ""
"Generatoren zur Erstellung der Depot-Liste. Generatoren benötigen die "
"Methodensignatur ``generator_name(context)``"

